  "datasheet_url": "https://www.nordicsemi.com/products/nrf51822",
  "notes": "Nordic nRF51822 BLE microcontroller on a Core51822-style module (on-board PCB antenna) flashed with custom firmware via OpenOCD + ST-Link V2 (VDD/GND/SWDIO/SWDCLK). Breaks out all 31 GPIO (P0.00-P0.30) plus power, SWD and RESET. The module is powered from the Pi's 3V3 rail (VDD) and shares GND. In this build only P0.00/P0.04 (idle HIGH) and P0.01/P0.03/P0.09 (idle LOW) are wired to the Raspberry Pi Zero W as signals; P0.29 (LED1) and the P0.13/P0.14 UART are used on the module but not routed to the Pi. P0.26/P0.27 double as the optional 32.768kHz crystal pins (XL1/XL2)."
